.TH geectl-gitea-cleanup-forks 1  "geectl-gitea-cleanup-forks 0.2.2" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-gitea\-cleanup\-forks \- List obsolete Gitea forks and their OBS home test projects, and delete them. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the deletion. A project is deleted only when its description marker names a fork that no longer exists on Gitea; every other project is listed and left in place
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl gitea cleanup\-forks\fR [\fB\-\-user\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List obsolete Gitea forks and their OBS home test projects, and delete them. A mutation: dry\-run is the default (only the plan is printed); `\-\-live` performs the deletion. A project is deleted only when its description marker names a fork that no longer exists on Gitea; every other project is listed and left in place
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-user\fR \fI<USER>\fR
The OBS user whose `home:<user>:branches:*` projects are listed; defaults to the OBS credential username
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH VERSION
v0.2.2
